  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "501c4d3e804b2e3a",
      "translationZh": "借助 Gemini 3.5 Live Translate，实现流畅自然的语音翻译",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a54d5acdef4d0829",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.5 Live Translate 是我们最新的音频模型，可提供覆盖超过 70 种语言的近实时语音到语音翻译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67e0f4e608be2df5",
      "translationZh": "高级资深软件工程师",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfee255c3a7fd629",
      "translationZh": "二十年前，Google 的翻译工作始于我们的一项开创性机器学习实验，旨在将语言科学转化为连接人与人的魔力。如今，这项实验已取得长足进展：每个月，我们的各款产品为数十亿用户翻译超过一万亿个词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a90843286409345c",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们迈出了下一步，发布了 Gemini 3.5 Live Translate，这是我们用于实时语音到语音翻译的最新音频模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20ed84af995645a4",
      "translationZh": "该模型可自动检测 70+ 种语言，并生成流畅、自然的翻译语音，同时保留说话者的语调、节奏和音高。与等待说话者说完后才作出响应的逐轮系统不同，3.5 Live Translate 会持续生成语音，在等待上下文以提高质量和立即翻译以跟上说话者之间取得平衡。它能提供流畅的音频，不会出现令人尴尬的停顿，并且在整个会话过程中始终仅比说话者滞后几秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2cfb2499c9d727c",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.5 Live Translate 从今天起开始在各项 Google 产品中陆续推出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ef5c1a456744e057",
      "translationZh": "面向开发者，通过 Gemini Live API 和 Google AI Studio 提供公开预览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ba87f8f53d20923",
      "translationZh": "面向企业，本月起在 Google Meet 中提供私有预览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6cd0fc1739e2d719",
      "translationZh": "面向所有用户，通过 Android 和 iOS 上的 Google Translate 提供",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "286ae3732c3dca9e",
      "translationZh": "使用 3.5 Live Translate 构建应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cedac15463fc2f4d",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.5 Live Translate 在语音流式传输的同时进行处理，让跨语言沟通更加顺畅。该模型能够处理多语言输入，无需手动配置设置。同时，其噪声鲁棒性确保应用能够应对嘈杂、不可预测的环境。你可以利用它的能力，为多语言通话、会议、课程、广播等场景提供实时口译支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bff98df1e7abee6",
      "translationZh": "观看 Gemini Live API 如何在实际应用中实现配音和多语言同声传译。深入探索演示，或查看 Gemini Cookbook 中的更多示例代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de51788b927feb4b",
      "translationZh": "通过利用 Gemini Live API，Agora、Fishjam、LiveKit、Pipecat 和 Vision Agents 等开发者平台让开发者能够轻松构建和部署语音翻译应用。这些集成负责处理复杂的实时媒体流基础设施，让开发者能够专注于用户体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3a5c05934f5679e",
      "translationZh": "我们的合作伙伴 Grab 正在测试该模型，以便司机和乘客在接驾时进行近乎实时的多语言沟通。这些用户每月通过 Grab 拨打超过 10 million 次语音通话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "310a10c5a847fa88",
      "translationZh": "阅读早期评价",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b8d642a7ff13ba7",
      "translationZh": "除 Grab 外，CJ ENM、LiveKit 等公司也对 3.5 Live Translate 给出了积极反馈，强调了其出色的翻译质量、准确性和低延迟：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d01374e0f388fcac",
      "translationZh": "在视频会议中体验 3.5 Live Translate",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1ec45da52abe229",
      "translationZh": "Google Meet 中的语音翻译即将使用 3.5 Live Translate，通过以下方式改善体验：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d443a18d07b2ff94",
      "translationZh": "提供 70+ 种语言，突破此前仅支持五种语言的限制，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec23b38311b93a95",
      "translationZh": "支持在同一场会议中通过超过 2000+ 种语言组合进行对话，不再像此前那样只能进行英语与其他语言之间的互译，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "291b27faa63d475f",
      "translationZh": "更新界面，让用户能够即时使用语音翻译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48abbb225f95d836",
      "translationZh": "从本月开始，我们将面向部分 Google Workspace 企业客户推出此更新的私享预览版，并将在今年晚些时候扩大推出范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "016256e19d3c3b07",
      "translationZh": "在 Android 或 iOS 上的 Google Translate 应用中使用 3.5 Live Translate",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f561aae012f41910",
      "translationZh": "该模型也正在全球范围内的 Google Translate 应用中陆续推出，覆盖 Android 和 iOS。使用 Live translate 功能时，只需连接任意一副耳机，即可体验更流畅的翻译，在 70+ 种语言之间保留说话者的语气。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f62f9c9e4160766",
      "translationZh": "对于 Android 用户，我们也开始通过 3.5 Live Translate 推出全新的“聆听模式”，让你直接通过手机听筒收听翻译。只需像平常打电话一样将手机贴近耳朵，翻译后的音频就会直接传入你的耳中。当你想快速听到翻译、不希望旁人听见，而且手边没有耳机时，这项新体验会很有帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9363f94b9ad31160",
      "translationZh": "使用新的聆听模式，用户可以直接通过手机听筒，听到西班牙语导览的近乎实时的英语翻译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6131b71f03ea0ef4",
      "translationZh": "使用 SynthID 添加水印",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fcb2cfaf6f5634a",
      "translationZh": "我们的模型生成的所有音频都会使用 SynthID 添加水印。这种无法感知的水印直接嵌入音频输出中，确保 AI 生成的内容仍可被检测出来，从而帮助防止虚假信息传播。如需了解我们在安全与责任方面的做法，请查阅模型卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在收件箱中接收 Google 的最新消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看收件箱，确认订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用一个 来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在2026年9月公布的最新 AI 消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81c0514443d15d43",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon：开启我们的前沿智能新时代",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "85ddfb24fee011a7",
      "translationZh": "庆祝国际翻译日：认识 Google Translate 背后的3位语言学专家",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
